{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、乃木坂４６、\n２０１２年初のイベントでした＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、明けましておめでとう\n御座います＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張したけど、楽しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、お忙しい中、\nイベントに来てくださった皆さん、\n来れずとも応援して下さった皆さん、\n本当に有難う御座いました(*^_^*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ういえあっ！(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/05/photo_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんがメイク中だったら、\nべびたん、まあや、あみちゃんが\nかぶりついてきたよっ (@_@)！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、みゅうみゅう、\n戻ってきてくれて有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で熱くて、誰よりも頑張り屋さんで、\n優しくて、面白い、みゅうみゅうが大好きだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまいこと言えないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"力合わせて頑張ってこうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}